kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni

45
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:32,630
Bu gece kalbim bile paramparça oldu

46
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:36,630
kimi no koe sagasu

47
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:36,630
Aciz olmaktan nefret ediyorum.

48
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:41,140
kono yowasa ga nikui yo

49
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:41,140
Sesinin özlemi

50
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:46,680
ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya

51
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:46,680
"Hemen geri dönmeliyim!"

52
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,270
baka darou?

53
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,270
